* from Qucs-S library/555_timer.lib <Component NE555_bipolar>
* <Spice> section as shipped by Qucs-S, nested; its ground pin is tied to node 0
.subckt NE555_bipolar gnd trig out reset ctrl thres disch vcc
XNE555_bipolar_q 0 gnd trig out reset ctrl thres disch vcc n555_timer_NE555_bipolar
* Qucs 1.0.1  555_timer_NE555_bipolar.sch

.subckt NE555 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
* NE555 Single Precision Timer
* 1 = GND
* 2 = TRIGGER
* 3 = OUTPUT
* 4 = RESET
* 5 = CONTROL VOLTAGE
* 6 = THRESHOLD
* 7 = DISCHARGE
* 8 = VCC
Q1 N002 N010 N012 0 NP
Q2 N002 6 N010 0 NP
Q3 N003 N011 N012 0 NP
Q4 N003 5 N011 0 NP
R1 N012 1 10K
Q5 N003 N003 8 0 PN
Q6 N006 N003 8 0 PN
Q7 N002 N002 8 0 PN
Q8 N008 N002 8 0 PN
Q9 N013 N004 N001 0 PN
R2 8 N001 1K
Q10 N023 N017 N013 0 PN
Q11 1 N019 N017 0 PN
Q12 N022 N016 N013 0 PN
Q13 1 2 N016 0 PN
Q14 N022 N023 1 0 NP
Q15 N023 N023 1 0 NP
R3 8 5 5K
R4 5 N019 5K
R5 N019 1 5K
Q16 N008 N006 1 0 NP
Q17 N006 N006 1 0 NP
Q18 N014 N022 1 0 NP
Q19 N018 N014 1 0 NP
Q20 N015 N018 1 0 NP
Q21 N009 N008 N014 0 NP
Q22 N009 N009 N018 0 NP
Q23 N004 N004 8 0 PN
Q24 N004 N004 8 0 PN
Q25 N015 N004 8 0 PN
R6 N004 N009 7.5K
